<title>PERU: Peru's Edelnor 9-mo net falls 22.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru's Edelnor 9-mo net falls 22.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 46.3 million soles vs 59.5 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 503.8 million soles vs 446.9 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Empresa de Distribucion Electrica de Lima Norte SA, which was privatized in July 1994, is one of Peru's largest electricity distributors.</p>
<p>It is owned by the Distrilima consortium consisting of Chilean companies Enersis and Distribuidora Chilectra and Spain's Endesa.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
